  "title": "Asia volume-profile levels: the original three setups",
  "summary": "The original A–C protocol studies POC reversal, value-boundary retest and pre-touch HVN fade on NQ. Matched-control evidence is mixed; later D/E extensions are excluded.",
  "publishedAt": "2026-10-06T23:09:36Z",
